# StatusList

> Lede 0.7.1's docs for StatusList, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/status-list.md

A list of items that may need a look, worst first, each ending in its status in words, with an empty text when there's nothing to list.

Experimental: its props can change in a minor release, which the CHANGELOG names. An item is experimental for the release that adds it, and stable once a release ships it unchanged.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/status-list
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md), [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md), [`list`](list.md) and [`status-text`](status-text.md). The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.7.1/status-list.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { StatusList } from '@/components/lede/blocks/status-list';
```

